  <h1>ILDA Files References</h1>
  <p>The jam package objects store ILDA files in its own global data structure.</p>
  <p>Working with ILDA files is somehow similar to working with other global data structures in Max, for example <link type="userguide" name="dictionaries">dictionaries</link>, <link type="userguide" name="arrays">arrays</link> or <link type="userguide" name="strings">strings</link>: ILDA files have names and can be passed between objects with messages like <m>ilda ild001485688762</m>.</p>
